    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/675d3c40bad389d1302842ad5f91c020.avif?t=1755401822\" width=616 height=249 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leap and climb through a perilous labyrinth of obstacles, all to find your way back home.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each jump demanding precision and persistence, you must navigate through difficult platforming levels, testing your feline reflexes and determination. While falling can be a setback, take comfort in the fact that cats have nine lives. However, beware, cats that use up their lives may experience unintended consequences... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/7d600e0589e640fa354e20021c83bd5e.avif?t=1755401822\" width=616 height=80 /></span><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/35930f31b5e5da9ee33b72e5496c857c.poster.avif?t=1755401822\" width=616 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/35930f31b5e5da9ee33b72e5496c857c.webm?t=1755401822\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/35930f31b5e5da9ee33b72e5496c857c.mp4?t=1755401822\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>   <br> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984970/extras/1a0c35cbe3fabca344d825aa9eba988c.avif?t=1755401822\" width=616 height=80 /></span><strong